1
00:05:26,666 --> 00:05:32,666
Dune Drifter is a science fiction film directed by Marc Price.

2
00:10:53,333 --> 00:10:59,333
When the trainee pilot and her mortally wounded gunner are
shot down, they crash land on a nearby planet.

3
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:26,000
An enemy craft offers the chance of spare parts to fix her ship, but then she spots another
survivor - an enemy alien soldier with no intention of letting her escape.

4
00:21:46,666 --> 00:21:52,666
Adler, played by Phoebe Sparrow.

5
00:27:13,333 --> 00:27:19,333
Yaren, played by Daisy Aitkens.

6
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:46,000
Erebus Drekk, played by Simon Dwyer-Thomas.

7
00:38:06,666 --> 00:38:12,666
Callaghan (grey leader), played by Charlotte Mounter.

8
00:43:33,333 --> 00:43:39,333
Col. Danforth, played by Alastair Kirton.

9
00:49:00,000 --> 00:49:06,000
Kinnear (lead gunner), played by Michael Geary.

10
00:54:26,666 --> 00:54:32,666
Dune Drifter is a 2020 British science fiction film written and
directed by Marc Price and produced by Michelle Parkyn.

11
00:59:53,333 --> 00:59:59,333
It stars Phoebe Sparrow, Daisy Aitkens, Simon Dwyer Thomas,
Alastair Kirton, Richard Corgan, and Michael Geary.

12
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
Exterior filming took place in 2019 on location in Iceland, taking advantage of the
natural rock formations and geysers to build an otherworldly atmosphere.

13
01:10:46,666 --> 01:10:52,666
The interiors of the spaceship cockpits were done in Price's
flat, in an effort to reduce budget costs.

14
01:16:13,333 --> 01:16:19,333
This was achieved by building a cockpit set and using projectors
and backdrops to mimic an outer space atmosphere.

15
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
Dune Drifter premiered at the 2020 Frightfest film festival on 24 October 2020, with
screenings held at the Leeds International Film Festival on 3 November 2020.

16
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
It was released on DVD on 1 December 2020.

17
01:32:33,333 --> 01:32:39,333
The tone is thought_provoking.
